- **Client** exposes `runWithPlot(code)` on `usePyodide()`.
- **Wiring**: registry (`pythonPlot`), `SectionSchema` discriminated union, build:schemas, `--widget-python-plot` CSS var (light + dark), lesson page (`WidgetEditPanel` + `SectionRenderer`).
- **Tests**: 4 new schema tests; full suite 112/112; typecheck + lint clean; `python-plot.json` regenerated.
- **Browser verified**: sin(x) renders on first Run (38 KB PNG), cos(x) renders after editing (37 KB PNG, different image), zero console errors. Screenshots at `/tmp/us-044-{1-initial,2-first-plot,3-second-plot}.png`.
